Teaser (SKILL.md, llms.txt, agents/catalog.json, 3-item samples) is free.

Production use of issues/latest.json or the compiled brief inside another agent, product, or paid skill requires the Signal Desk Agent license ($49/mo).

Foundry output (SKILL.md for a customer repo) is licensed to the paying sku (foundry-public $49 or foundry-private $199).
